  "changelog": "**Everything Openclaw (EO) supercharges OpenClaw with a collaborative, expert-driven multi-agent engine and 15 core innovations.**\n\n- Adds 141 pre-built experts across 13 domains and a Skills+Experts dual system.\n- Introduces 9 standardized commands (e.g., /plan, /architect, /verify) for specialized expert tasks.\n- Supports multi-expert parallel execution, proactive memory management, and checkpoint validation for robust workflows.\n- Features seamless compatibility with existing OpenClaw and Claude Code skills.\n- Provides bilingual (English + \u4e2d\u6587) documentation and open, commercial-friendly (MIT-0) licensing.",
